# wined3d: Support WINE_D3D_CONFIG=no_create_flags=0x800 (bug #50277)
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/11398 state=opened
# Fix for UnityPlayer.dll calls to D3D11_CREATE_DEVICE_VIDEO_SUPPORT until supported.

Forces UnityPlayer.dll software video decoding which skips all the cross-device multi-thread calls involving dxgi_resource_GetSharedHandle and d3d11_device_OpenSharedResource.

https://bugs.winehq.org/show_bug.cgi?id=50277#c46
